      "signature": "\u2200 {n m : \u2115} (H : BfgsVerification.Mat n) (Z : Matrix (Fin n) (Fin m) \u211d) (g y : BfgsVerification.Vec n) (\u03b1 : \u211d),\n  Matrix.PosDef H \u2192\n    Function.Injective Z.mulVec \u2192\n      0 < \u03b1 \u2192\n        0 < BfgsVerification.metricEnergy H g \u2192\n          0 < -BfgsVerification.dot y (Matrix.mulVec H g) / BfgsVerification.metricEnergy H g \u2192\n            let q := BfgsVerification.metricEnergy H g;\n            let \u03b2 := -BfgsVerification.dot y (Matrix.mulVec H g) / q;\n            (BfgsVerification.metricGram (BfgsVerification.inverseBFGS H (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep H g \u03b1) y) Z).det \u2264\n              (BfgsVerification.metricGram H ((Matrix.replicateCol Unit y).fromCols Z)).det / (\u03b2 ^ 2 * q) +\n                \u03b1 / \u03b2 * (BfgsVerification.metricGram H Z).det",
