      "theorem": "BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.certified_plateau",
      "signature": "\u2200 {n : \u2115},\n  1 \u2264 n \u2192\n    \u2200 {z : BfgsVerification.Vec 2} {i : Fin 3},\n      BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.PointCertificate BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD z\n          i \u2192\n        \u2200 (j : Fin 3),\n          |BfgsVerification.dot\n                (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.gradient BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD\n                  j)\n                (BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale n ^ 2 \u2022 z)| <\n            BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale n / 2",
