      "signature": "\u2200 {b : \u211d},\n  2 \u2264 b \u2192\n    b \u2264 34 \u2192\n      ContDiff \u211d 2 (BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b) \u2227\n        ConvexOn \u211d Set.univ (BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b) \u2227\n          (\u2200 (x : \u211d), 0 \u2264 BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b x) \u2227\n            (\u2200 (x : \u211d), BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b x = 0 \u2194 x = 0) \u2227\n              Filter.Tendsto (BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b) (Filter.cocompact \u211d) Filter.atTop \u2227\n                (\u2200 (a : \u211d), IsCompact {x | BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b x \u2264 a}) \u2227\n                  (\u2200 (x : \u211d), HasDerivAt (BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b) (BfgsVerification.DScalar.phiFirst b x) x) \u2227\n                    (\u2200 (x : \u211d),\n                        HasDerivAt (BfgsVerification.DScalar.phiFirst b) (BfgsVerification.DScalar.phiSecond b x) x) \u2227\n                      (\u2200 (x : \u211d),\n                          0 \u2264 deriv (deriv (BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b)) x \u2227\n                            deriv (deriv (BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b)) x \u2264 max 6 (102 / b)) \u2227\n                        LipschitzWith \u27e8max 6 (139264 / (5 * b ^ 2)), \u22ef\u27e9\n                            (deriv (deriv (BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b))) \u2227\n                          (\u2200 (m : \u2115),\n                              BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b (b * BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m) =\n                                  BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m ^ 3 \u2227\n                                HasDerivAt (BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b)\n                                    (BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m ^ 2)\n                                    (b * BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m) \u2227\n                                  HasDerivAt (deriv (BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b)) 0\n                                    (b * BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m)) \u2227\n                            (\u2200 (m : \u2115) (h : \u211d),\n                                |h| \u2264 BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m / 2 \u2192\n                                  BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b (b * BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m + h) =\n                                    BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m ^ 3 +\n                                      BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m ^ 2 * h) \u2227\n                              (\u2200 x \u2264 -1, BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b x = 1 - 3 * (x + 1) + 3 * (x + 1) ^ 2) \u2227\n                                (\u2200 (x : \u211d), -1 \u2264 x \u2192 x \u2264 0 \u2192 BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b x = -x ^ 3) \u2227\n                                  (\u2200 (x : \u211d), b \u2264 x \u2192 BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b x = 1 + x - b) \u2227\n                                    \u2200 (m : \u2115) (x : \u211d),\n                                      b * BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.theta *\n                                            BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m \u2264\n                                          x \u2192\n                                        x \u2264 b * BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m \u2192\n                                          BfgsVerification.DScalar.phi b x =\n                                            (BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.theta *\n                                                  BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m) ^\n                                                3 +\n                                              b * BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m ^ 3 *\n                                                  (1 - BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.theta) *\n                                                (BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.theta ^ 2 *\n                                                    BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.coordinate b\n                                                      (BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m) x +\n                                                  (1 - BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.theta ^ 2) *\n                                                    BfgsVerification.DScalarRamp.primitive b\n                                                      (BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.coordinate b\n                                                        (BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m) x))",
