      "signature": "\u2200 {F : BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.State \u2192L[\u211d] BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.State} {ls rho alpha lu : \u211d}\n  (E : BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.Coordinates \u2243L[\u211d] BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.State),\n  (\u2200 (w : BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.Coordinates),\n      F (E w) =\n        E\n          ((BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.diagonalMap ![ls, rho]) w.1,\n            (BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.diagonalMap ![alpha, alpha, lu]) w.2)) \u2192\n    (\u2191F).charpoly =\n      (Polynomial.X - Polynomial.C alpha) ^ 2 * (Polynomial.X - Polynomial.C ls) * (Polynomial.X - Polynomial.C lu) *\n        (Polynomial.X - Polynomial.C rho)",
