      "signature": "\u2200 {F : BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.State \u2192L[\u211d] BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.State} {rho a b c d ls lu : \u211d}\n  {p q h k : BfgsVerification.Vec 2},\n  BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.BlockForm F rho\u207b\u00b9 rho a b c d p q h k \u2192\n    0 < rho \u2192\n      rho < 1 \u2192\n        0 < ls \u2192\n          ls < rho \u2192\n            1 < lu \u2192\n              lu < rho\u207b\u00b9 \u2192\n                b \u2260 0 \u2192\n                  (ls - a) * (ls - d) = b * c \u2192\n                    (lu - a) * (lu - d) = b * c \u2192\n                      \u2203 E,\n                        (\u2200 (w : BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.Coordinates), E w 4 = w.1 1) \u2227\n                          \u2200 (w : BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.Coordinates),\n                            F (E w) =\n                              E\n                                ((BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.diagonalMap ![ls, rho]) w.1,\n                                  (BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.diagonalMap ![rho\u207b\u00b9, rho\u207b\u00b9, lu]) w.2)",
