      "signature": "\u2200 {\u03bc c\u2081 c\u2082 : \u211d} (D : BfgsVerification.LFlatten.Data \u03bc c\u2081 c\u2082) (h\u03bc : 0 \u2264 \u03bc) (hc\u2081 : 0 < c\u2081) (hc : c\u2081 < c\u2082) (hc\u2082 : c\u2082 < 1),\n  Filter.Tendsto D.state Filter.atTop (nhds BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.seed) \u2192\n    let R := D.run h\u03bc hc\u2081 hc hc\u2082;\n    Filter.Tendsto R.x Filter.atTop (nhds 0) \u2227\n      Filter.Tendsto R.H Filter.atTop (nhds 0) \u2227\n        Filter.Tendsto (fun k => BfgsVerification.LQuadraticSeed.objective \u03bc (R.x k)) Filter.atTop (nhds 0) \u2227\n          (\u2200 (k : \u2115), 0 < BfgsVerification.LQuadraticSeed.objective \u03bc (R.x k)) \u2227\n            (\u2200 (k : \u2115),\n                BfgsVerification.LQuadraticSeed.objective \u03bc (R.x (k + 1)) <\n                  BfgsVerification.LQuadraticSeed.objective \u03bc (R.x k)) \u2227\n              (\u2200 (k : \u2115),\n                  BfgsVerification.DeterministicLineSearch.fromMetric (BfgsVerification.LQuadraticSeed.objective \u03bc)\n                      (R.x k) (R.H k) c\u2081 c\u2082 5 =\n                    (some (R.\u03b1 k), BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialHistory (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.phase k))) \u2227\n                (\u2200 (k : \u2115) (q : Fin 9),\n                    BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialPhase q = BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.phase k \u2192\n                      DifferentiableAt \u211d (BfgsVerification.LQuadraticSeed.objective \u03bc)\n                        (R.x k +\n                          BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialLength q \u2022 BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (R.H k) (R.g k) 1)) \u2227\n                  (\u2200 (q : \u2115 \u2192 Fin 9),\n                      (\u2200 (k : \u2115), BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialPhase (q k) = BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.phase k) \u2192\n                        Filter.Tendsto\n                          (fun k =>\n                            R.x k +\n                              BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialLength (q k) \u2022\n                                BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (R.H k) (R.g k) 1)\n                          Filter.atTop (nhds 0)) \u2227\n                    0 \u2209\n                      BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential\n                        (BfgsVerification.LQuadraticSeed.objective \u03bc) 0",
      "axioms": [
        "Classical.choice",
        "Quot.sound",
