        (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedOracle.physicalPoint \u03bc w\n                                (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialPhase q) +\n                              BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialLength q \u2022\n                                BfgsVerification.bfgsStep\n                                  (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedOracle.physicalMetric \u03bc w\n                                    (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialPhase q))\n                                  (BfgsVerification.coordinateGradient (BfgsVerification.LQuadraticSeed.objective \u03bc)\n                                    (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedOracle.physicalPoint \u03bc w\n                                      (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialPhase q)))\n                                  1)) \u2227\n                        (\u2200 (q : Fin 9),\n                            0 <\n                              BfgsVerification.LQuadraticSeed.objective \u03bc\n                                (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.scale w \u2022\n                                  BfgsVerification.LNormalizedOracle.trialPoint \u03bc w\n                                    (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialPhase q)\n                                    (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialLength q))) \u2227\n                          0 < BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.returnFactor \u03bc w \u2227\n                            BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.scale\n                                    (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.returnMap \u03bc w) \u2022\n                                  BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.point\n                                    (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.returnMap \u03bc w) =\n                                BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.scale w \u2022\n                                  (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.internal \u03bc w 3).1 \u2227\n                              BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.scale\n                                    (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.returnMap \u03bc w) \u2022\n                                  BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.shape\n                                    (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.returnMap \u03bc w) =\n                                BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.scale w \u2022\n                                  (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.internal \u03bc w 3).2",
