      "theorem": "BfgsVerification.LWhitening.failure_search",
      "signature": "\u2200 {F : BfgsVerification.Vec 2 \u2192 \u211d} (D : BfgsVerification.LActualCopies.CopyData F) (m k : \u2115),\n  BfgsVerification.DeterministicLineSearch.fromMetric\n      (BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.objective BfgsVerification.LWhitening.coordinateMatrix F)\n      ((BfgsVerification.LWhitening.failureFamily D m).x k) ((BfgsVerification.LWhitening.failureFamily D m).H k)\n      (1 / 10000) (1 / 2) 5 =\n    (some ((BfgsVerification.LWhitening.failureFamily D m).\u03b1 k),\n      BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialHistory (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.phase k))",
