      "signature": "\u2200 {F : BfgsVerification.Vec 2 \u2192 \u211d} (D : BfgsVerification.LActualCopies.CopyData F) (m k : \u2115) (q : Fin 9),\n  BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialPhase q = BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.phase k \u2192\n    DifferentiableAt \u211d (BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.objective BfgsVerification.LWhitening.coordinateMatrix F)\n        ((BfgsVerification.LWhitening.failureFamily D m).x k +\n          BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialLength q \u2022\n            BfgsVerification.bfgsStep ((BfgsVerification.LWhitening.failureFamily D m).H k)\n              ((BfgsVerification.LWhitening.failureFamily D m).g k) 1) \u2227\n      0 <\n        BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.objective BfgsVerification.LWhitening.coordinateMatrix F\n          ((BfgsVerification.LWhitening.failureFamily D m).x k +\n            BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialLength q \u2022\n              BfgsVerification.bfgsStep ((BfgsVerification.LWhitening.failureFamily D m).H k)\n                ((BfgsVerification.LWhitening.failureFamily D m).g k) 1)",
