      D' (Set.Ici t) t \u2227\n                            |D' /\n                                  BfgsVerification.HomogeneousPlanar.pairDet s\n                                    (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF \u03c7 v (x + t \u2022 s))| \u2264\n                              max (6 * M / (\u03ba * \u03bc)) (A / \u03ba) * |a|",
