      "signature": "\u2200 {n : \u2115} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n \u2192 \u211d},\n  ConvexOn \u211d Set.univ F \u2192\n    \u2200 (star x go gm gi : BfgsVerification.Vec n) (t C : \u211d),\n      0 \u2264 t \u2192\n        t \u2264 1 / 2 \u2192\n          0 \u2264 C \u2192\n            HasFDerivAt F (BfgsVerification.gradientFunctional go)\n                (BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.outwardPoint star x t) \u2192\n              HasFDerivAt F (BfgsVerification.gradientFunctional gm) x \u2192\n                HasFDerivAt F (BfgsVerification.gradientFunctional gi)\n                    (BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.inwardPoint star x t) \u2192\n                  (0 <\n                        BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.secantCurvature\n                          (BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.outwardPoint star x t) x go gm \u2192\n                      BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.radialNumerator star x go gm ^ 2 \u2264\n                        C *\n                          BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.secantCurvature\n                            (BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.outwardPoint star x t) x go gm) \u2192\n                    (0 <\n                          BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.secantCurvature x\n                            (BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.inwardPoint star x t) gm gi \u2192\n                        BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.radialNumerator star\n                              (BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.inwardPoint star x t) gm gi ^\n                            2 \u2264\n                          C *\n                            BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.secantCurvature x\n                              (BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.inwardPoint star x t) gm gi) \u2192\n                      BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.centralDifference F star x t \u2264 5 * C * t ^ 2",
