      "signature": "\u2200 {F : BfgsVerification.Vec 2 \u2192 \u211d} {p : BfgsVerification.Vec 2} {t A c\u2081 c\u2082 : \u211d},\n  BfgsVerification.SeedEmbedding.Data F p t A \u2192\n    0 < t \u2192\n      0 < c\u2081 \u2192\n        c\u2081 \u2264 1 / 3 \u2192\n          0 < c\u2082 \u2192\n            \u2200 (k : \u2115),\n              F (BfgsVerification.SeedEmbedding.point p t (k + 1)) <\n                  F (BfgsVerification.SeedEmbedding.point p t k) +\n                    c\u2081 *\n                      BfgsVerification.dot (BfgsVerification.SeedEmbedding.gradient t k)\n                        (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.orbitMetric k)\n                          (BfgsVerification.SeedEmbedding.gradient t k) (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.orbitLength k)) \u2227\n                c\u2082 *\n                    BfgsVerification.dot (BfgsVerification.SeedEmbedding.gradient t k)\n                      (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.orbitMetric k)\n                        (BfgsVerification.SeedEmbedding.gradient t k) (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.orbitLength k)) <\n                  BfgsVerification.dot (BfgsVerification.SeedEmbedding.gradient t (k + 1))\n                    (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.orbitMetric k)\n                      (BfgsVerification.SeedEmbedding.gradient t k) (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.orbitLength k))",
