    {
      "theorem": "BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.actual_coercive_deterministic_failure",
      "signature": "\u2200 {c\u2081 c\u2082 : \u211d} (hc\u2081 : 0 < c\u2081) (hc\u2081' : c\u2081 \u2264 1 / 3) (hc : c\u2081 < c\u2082) (hc\u2082 : c\u2082 < 1),\n  let R := BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.coerciveRun c\u2081 c\u2082 hc\u2081 hc\u2081' hc hc\u2082;\n  (\u2200 (a : \u211d), IsCompact {x | BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.coerciveObjective x \u2264 a}) \u2227\n    BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.coerciveObjective BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.coerciveOptimizer = -1 \u2227\n      (\u2200 (x : BfgsVerification.Vec 2), -1 \u2264 BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.coerciveObjective x) \u2227\n        (\u2200 (x : BfgsVerification.Vec 2),\n            BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.coerciveObjective x = -1 \u2192 x = BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.coerciveOptimizer) \u2227\n          R.H 0 = 1 \u2227\n            Filter.Tendsto R.x Filter.atTop (nhds 0) \u2227\n              Filter.Tendsto (fun k => BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.coerciveObjective (R.x k)) Filter.atTop (nhds 0) \u2227\n                (\u2200 (k : \u2115), 0 < BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.coerciveObjective (R.x k)) \u2227\n                  (\u2200 (k : \u2115),\n                      BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.coerciveObjective (R.x (k + 1)) <\n                        BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.coerciveObjective (R.x k)) \u2227\n                    0 \u2209\n                        BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential\n                          BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.coerciveObjective 0 \u2227\n                      \u2200 (k : \u2115),\n                        BfgsVerification.DeterministicLineSearch.fromMetric BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.coerciveObjective\n                            (R.x k) (R.H k) c\u2081 c\u2082 5 =\n                          (some (R.\u03b1 k), BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialHistory (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.phase k))",
      "axioms": [
        "Classical.choice",
        "Quot.sound",
        "propext"
      ],
      "source": "BfgsVerification/AlgebraicSeedCoercive.lean"
    },
