      "signature": "\u2200 (a b c \u03c3 \u03b1 : \u211d),\n  \u03c3 ^ 2 = 1 \u2192\n    BfgsVerification.TwoPieceBudget.cross a b \u03c3 \u2260 0 \u2192\n      let A := BfgsVerification.TwoPieceBudget.energy a b c \u03c3;\n      let B := BfgsVerification.TwoPieceBudget.cross a b \u03c3;\n      let D := BfgsVerification.TwoPieceBudget.determinant a b c;\n      let a' := \u03b1 * B / 2;\n      let b' := \u03c3 * \u03b1 * (A - B) / 2;\n      let c' := D * A / B ^ 2 + \u03b1 * (A - B) ^ 2 / (2 * B);\n      BfgsVerification.TwoPieceBudget.energy a' b' c' (-\u03c3) = D * A / B ^ 2 + \u03b1 * (A - 2 * B) ^ 2 / (2 * B) \u2227\n        BfgsVerification.TwoPieceBudget.cross a' b' (-\u03c3) = \u03b1 * (B - A / 2) \u2227\n          BfgsVerification.TwoPieceBudget.determinant a' b' c' = \u03b1 * A * D / (2 * B)",
      "axioms": [
