      "signature": "\u2200 (A : \u211d) {\u03c3 r \u03c1 : \u211d},\n  \u03c3 ^ 2 = 1 \u2192\n    0 < r \u2192\n      0 < \u03c1 \u2192\n        (BfgsVerification.UnexcitedMetric.objective (BfgsVerification.UnexcitedMetric.point \u03c3 r) -\n                BfgsVerification.UnexcitedMetric.objective (BfgsVerification.UnexcitedMetric.point (-\u03c3) (\u03c1 * r))) /\n              -BfgsVerification.dot (BfgsVerification.UnexcitedMetric.gradient \u03c3)\n                  (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (BfgsVerification.UnexcitedMetric.diagonal A ((1 + \u03c1) / (2 * \u03c1) * r))\n                    (BfgsVerification.UnexcitedMetric.gradient \u03c3) (2 * \u03c1)) =\n            (1 - \u03c1) / (1 + \u03c1) \u2227\n          BfgsVerification.dot (BfgsVerification.UnexcitedMetric.gradient (-\u03c3))\n                (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (BfgsVerification.UnexcitedMetric.diagonal A ((1 + \u03c1) / (2 * \u03c1) * r))\n                  (BfgsVerification.UnexcitedMetric.gradient \u03c3) (2 * \u03c1)) /\n              BfgsVerification.dot (BfgsVerification.UnexcitedMetric.gradient \u03c3)\n                (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (BfgsVerification.UnexcitedMetric.diagonal A ((1 + \u03c1) / (2 * \u03c1) * r))\n                  (BfgsVerification.UnexcitedMetric.gradient \u03c3) (2 * \u03c1)) =\n            -1",
